sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Creation approval and acceptance for an ordinary project member
  accDescr: After submission, the project manager reviews first, the team leader gives final approval and issues the task, then the owner accepts. Assignment alone is not an execution commitment.
  actor C as Creator
  actor P as Project manager
  actor L as Team leader
  actor O as Task owner
  C->>P: Submit for approval
  Note over C,O: Team-visible after submission<br/>Creator and owner may differ
  P->>L: Approve first level
  Note over P,L: Still in Creation approval<br/>Waiting for team leader
  L->>O: Final approval and issue
  Note over L,O: State: Awaiting acceptance
  O->>O: Accept (optionally start)
  Note over O: Accepting the agreement<br/>creates the execution commitment
